Now main.js.

Let me carefully code the game class and boot.

```js
import * as THREE from 'three';
import './style.css';
import { World } from './world.js';
...
class Game {
 constructor() { this.state='loading'; this.money=1250; this.wanted=0; this.cameraYaw=0; this.cameraPitch=0.2; ... this.clock? }
 async boot() {
